{"id": "union-name-outside-money", "title": "Where six union-sponsored committees reported raising $7.3 million", "seconds": 167.6, "voice": "elevenlabs:OUMCzFUTd0F4Q6lkLkco", "narrator": "Roxy", "tempo": 1.2, "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "7eddfcf21e4b61ca", "words": 492, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "A campaign ad signed by firefighters carries weight. But whose money is behind it?", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.39, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Sponsored by the firefighters", "sub": "a campaign mailer"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.67, 0.98, 1.26, 1.41, 2.03, 2.36, 3.22, 3.4, 3.65, 3.9, 4.02, 4.43]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["oneLine"], "text": "Since 2015, 6 committees sponsored by a union raised 7.3 million dollars.", "t0": 5.39, "t1": 10.05, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "6 union-sponsored committees", "sub": "since 2015, $7.3 million raised"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.35, 0.65, 1.17, 1.45, 1.81, 2.24, 2.37, 2.47, 2.76, 2.98, 3.26, 3.5, 3.76, 4.1]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["oneLine"], "text": "Which receipts came from businesses, other committees and large individual donors?", "t0": 10.17, "t1": 14.76, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "6 union-sponsored committees", "sub": "since 2015, $7.3 million raised"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.68, 0.9, 1.09, 1.85, 2.12, 2.57, 2.71, 3.02, 3.51]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["amount", "oneLine", "story[0]", "established[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "6.3 million dollars.", "t0": 14.76, "t1": 16.63, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$6.3 million", "label": "Classified by immediate donor", "sub": "Businesses, other committees and large individual donors"}, "emph": ["6.3 million"], "wt": [0.04, 0.37, 0.65, 0.92, 1.29]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "caveat", "ref": ["caveat"], "text": "This is a lead, not a finding.", "t0": 17.15, "t1": 18.59, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "caveat", "line": "This is a lead, not a finding: a pattern in public records. This film says what the records show, what they do not show, and what would settle it."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.3, 0.38, 0.7, 0.86, 0.93]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "By City law, a firm seeking a contract of 100,000 dollars or more", "t0": 18.81, "t1": 22.49, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "The contractor rule", "sub": "contracts of $100,000 or more", "chip": "12 months"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.49, 0.77, 0.87, 1.18, 1.5, 1.58, 2.08, 2.22, 2.4, 2.69, 3.02, 3.35, 3.48]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "can't give to the official approving it, for twelve months.", "t0": 22.49, "t1": 25.36, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "The contractor rule", "sub": "contracts of $100,000 or more", "chip": "12 months"}, "emph": ["twelve months"], "wt": [0.04, 0.32, 0.52, 0.61, 0.71, 1.07, 1.5, 1.96, 2.13, 2.45]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[4]", "established[2]"], "text": "And a person can give a candidate only 500 dollars. So here's the gap.", "t0": 25.48, "t1": 29.48, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "money", "name": "Donor", "sub": "gives any amount"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Committee", "sub": "spends on its own"}, {"art": "cityhall", "name": "Candidate", "sub": "never touches the money"}], "kicker": "The gap in the rule"}, "emph": ["500"], "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.25, 0.57, 0.71, 0.83, 0.88, 1.37, 1.61, 1.87, 2.15, 3.04, 3.27, 3.56, 3.66]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[4]", "established[2]"], "text": "Neither rule covers a committee that spends on its own.", "t0": 29.6, "t1": 32.01, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "money", "name": "Donor", "sub": "gives any amount"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Committee", "sub": "spends on its own"}, {"art": "cityhall", "name": "Candidate", "sub": "never touches the money"}], "kicker": "The gap in the rule"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.38, 0.63, 0.94, 0.99, 1.3, 1.44, 1.79, 1.91, 2.09]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "story[1]"], "text": "The first lead: in 2018, a Firefighters Local 798 committee backed London Breed for mayor.", "t0": 32.23, "t1": 38.22, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "For London Breed, Mayor 2018", "kicker": "The first lead", "sub": "sponsored by Firefighters Local 798"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.4, 1.1, 1.27, 1.57, 1.97, 2.04, 2.64, 2.96, 3.22, 3.53, 4.04, 4.45, 4.76, 5.11, 5.43, 5.58]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "story[1]"], "text": "How much of the $1,006,500 was in that direct-donor group?", "t0": 38.34, "t1": 41.44, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "For London Breed, Mayor 2018", "kicker": "The first lead", "sub": "sponsored by Firefighters Local 798"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.4, 0.48, 0.57, 0.84, 1.03, 1.34, 1.67, 1.81, 1.89, 2.03, 2.62]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "story[1]"], "text": "86 percent.", "t0": 41.44, "t1": 42.52, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "86%", "label": "Classified by immediate donor", "sub": "$869,000"}, "emph": ["86"], "wt": [0.04, 0.58]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "Progress San Francisco gave $410,000. It received money from business and labor organizations.", "t0": 43.04, "t1": 49.4, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Direct contributors", "rows": [["Progress San Francisco", "$410,000"], ["SF Association of Realtors", "$74,500"], ["Pilot Construction Management", "$50,000"], ["An individual donor", "$50,000"], ["An individual donor", "$49,000"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.47, 0.65, 1.15, 1.38, 1.64, 1.96, 2.22, 2.57, 3.66, 3.83, 4.19, 4.42, 4.62, 5.04, 5.18, 5.48]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[1]"], "text": "The second lead is a City contractor.", "t0": 49.62, "t1": 51.41, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2018-03-13", "to": "fiscal 2019 on", "days": "", "fromLab": "$50,000 gift", "toLab": "City payments", "kicker": "The second lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.43, 0.66, 0.79, 0.86, 1.11]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[1]"], "text": "In March 2018, Pilot Construction Management gave 50,000 dollars.", "t0": 51.53, "t1": 55.41, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2018-03-13", "to": "fiscal 2019 on", "days": "", "fromLab": "$50,000 gift", "toLab": "City payments", "kicker": "The second lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.48, 0.77, 1.29, 1.62, 2.1, 2.53, 2.73, 3.03, 3.39]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[1]"], "text": "What has the City paid it since 2019?", "t0": 55.53, "t1": 57.72, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2018-03-13", "to": "fiscal 2019 on", "days": "", "fromLab": "$50,000 gift", "toLab": "City payments", "kicker": "The second lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.28, 0.38, 0.63, 0.88, 1.0, 1.25, 1.55]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what"], "text": "30.9 million dollars.", "t0": 57.72, "t1": 59.49, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$30,854,456", "label": "City payments since fiscal 2019"}, "emph": ["30.9"], "wt": [0.04, 0.38, 0.64, 0.88, 1.23]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "story[2]"], "text": "The third lead: a 2016 committee for Ahsha Safaí.", "t0": 59.71, "t1": 62.56, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "Protect SF, 2016", "kicker": "The third lead", "sub": "for Ahsha Safaí, supervisor"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.4, 0.74, 0.83, 1.13, 1.54, 1.87, 2.06, 2.33]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "story[2]"], "text": "Its sponsors: the firefighters and Progress San Francisco.", "t0": 62.68, "t1": 65.85, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "Protect SF, 2016", "kicker": "The third lead", "sub": "for Ahsha Safaí, supervisor"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.93, 1.08, 1.75, 1.87, 2.32, 2.51]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "The second sponsor gave 590,000 dollars.", "t0": 65.97, "t1": 68.68, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$590,000", "label": "from Progress San Francisco", "sub": "The second sponsor"}, "emph": ["590,000"], "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.4, 0.81, 1.02, 1.26, 1.57, 1.86, 2.2]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "story[3]"], "text": "The fourth lead is bonds.", "t0": 68.9, "t1": 70.14, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "Earthquake-safety bonds", "kicker": "The fourth lead", "sub": "2020 and 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.41, 0.62, 0.73]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "story[3]"], "text": "Firefighters sponsored yes campaigns in 2020 and 2026.", "t0": 70.26, "t1": 74.19, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "Earthquake-safety bonds", "kicker": "The fourth lead", "sub": "2020 and 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.64, 1.1, 1.33, 1.91, 2.03, 2.33, 2.74, 2.91, 3.2]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what"], "text": "In 2020, 85 percent of $792,200 came from that direct-donor group.", "t0": 74.31, "t1": 80.19, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["2020, Yes on B", "$792,200 · 85%"], "b": ["2026, Yes on A", "$1,683,432 · 70%"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.46, 1.26, 1.76, 2.11, 2.21, 2.47, 2.78, 3.24, 3.63, 3.82, 4.09, 4.49, 4.7, 4.85, 5.0, 5.59]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what"], "text": "Mitchell Engineering gave 5,000, and got 176.5 million.", "t0": 80.31, "t1": 85.25, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "City-paid donors, and what the City paid them", "rows": [["Mitchell Engineering, $5,000", "$176.5 million"], ["Jmb Construction Inc., $5,000", "$166.7 million"], ["Swinerton Builders, $5,000", "$130.9 million"], ["Ranger Pipelines, Inc., $10,000", "$127.6 million"]]}, "emph": ["176.5 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.38, 0.87, 1.09, 2.36, 2.53, 2.73, 2.91, 3.3, 3.9, 4.17, 4.47]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why"], "text": "Voters were asked to borrow; firms that get the money helped pay the campaign.", "t0": 85.37, "t1": 89.22, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "funded in part by companies that receive the proceeds"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.4, 0.55, 0.77, 0.85, 1.67, 2.04, 2.16, 2.32, 2.41, 2.66, 2.92, 3.14, 3.23]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[4]"], "text": "The fifth lead: a 2026 housing measure, under the building trades council's name.", "t0": 89.44, "t1": 94.25, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Yes on C, No on I", "kicker": "The fifth lead", "sub": "a 2026 housing measure"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.43, 1.21, 1.34, 1.68, 2.24, 2.6, 3.05, 3.28, 3.36, 3.68, 4.01, 4.48]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[4]"], "text": "How much of $2,727,749 fell in the direct-donor group?", "t0": 94.37, "t1": 98.07, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Yes on C, No on I", "kicker": "The fifth lead", "sub": "a 2026 housing measure"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.37, 0.46, 0.72, 0.92, 1.18, 1.44, 1.73, 2.1, 2.32, 2.39, 2.47, 3.04]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4].what", "suspicious[4].why", "established[9]"], "text": "96 percent. The direct contributors included property companies and other political committees.", "t0": 98.07, "t1": 103.53, "shot": "b22", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "96%", "label": "Classified by immediate donor", "sub": "By contrast, 2024 Yes on H: $2,213,950 of $2,325,306 from firefighter unions"}, "emph": ["96"], "wt": [0.04, 0.62, 1.79, 