: "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[4]", "established[5]", "story[7]"], "text": "And 9 of 13 gave less around agreement years, not more.", "t0": 121.1, "t1": 124.18, "shot": "p3", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That giving caused anything: 11 unions is a description", "9 of 13 families gave less around agreement years"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.4, 0.48, 0.94, 1.16, 1.38, 1.6, 2.0, 2.5, 2.73]}, {"scene": "pay", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[7]", "story[9]"], "text": "The Controller’s cost letters price the largest premiums: police retention pay, 9.9 million dollars.", "t0": 124.3, "t1": 130.12, "shot": "p4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$9.9 million", "label": "police retention pay, added in the last year of the 2026 agreement", "sub": "fire training and education: $6.0 million", "kicker": "Controller’s cost letters"}, "emph": ["9.9 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.65, 0.98, 1.32, 1.62, 1.71, 2.08, 2.83, 3.18, 3.65, 4.26, 4.52, 4.76, 4.97, 5.29]}, {"scene": "pay", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[7]", "story[9]"], "text": "Fire training and education, 6 million. No link to the giving is claimed.", "t0": 130.24, "t1": 134.21, "shot": "p4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$9.9 million", "label": "police retention pay, added in the last year of the 2026 agreement", "sub": "fire training and education: $6.0 million", "kicker": "Controller’s cost letters"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.37, 0.68, 0.8, 1.4, 1.66, 2.45, 2.71, 2.95, 3.04, 3.11, 3.38, 3.5]}, {"scene": "record", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[10]"], "text": "The statements distinguish campaigns that actually name the firefighters’ union as sponsor.", "t0": 134.43, "t1": 138.63, "shot": "record-10-Local 798", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "w25u7", "text": "Local 798", "mark": "Local 798", "kicker": "San Francisco Ethics Commission"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.55, 1.04, 1.56, 1.69, 2.08, 2.34, 2.42, 3.08, 3.41, 3.57]}, {"scene": "record", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[11]"], "t